{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0413_1000_p", "source_sha256": "27ed7bc93b561f28c6aa213eb76007bdb5b93092799b49d6bd508b5d09397f32", "ja": "（今日は細かい事務作業だ。息抜きに屋上まで来たが\n……あれ？　どうやら先客がいたみたいだ）", "zh": "（今天一直在做琐碎的事务工作。为了放松一下来到了楼顶，\n……咦？看来已经有人先来了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0413_1001_p", "source_sha256": "6644e7403af7eabe7d73003421503685f19925af7e5abca1faf22648afba644f", "ja": "こんなところでどうしたんだ、育？\nたしか今日は、ダンスのレッスン日だったよな。", "zh": "育，你怎么会在这种地方？\n我记得今天应该是舞蹈课吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0413_1002_030iku", "source_sha256": "3f82f4aa8dab6a9efe00fdf8000f5f52e67bc78eac5ba43e59373950ad3395ed", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん。うん……今日ね、\nレッスンで新しいダンスを教えてもらったんだ。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生。嗯……今天啊，\n老师在课程上教了我一支新舞蹈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0413_1003_030iku", "source_sha256": "1c9d73b5ceada14d432861b057bfdc2cb743546c6794f2800873212d6bbfed1f", "ja": "でも振り付けが、すっごくむずかしくて、\nわたし、上手におどれなかったの……。", "zh": "可是舞蹈动作特别难，我没能跳好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0413_1004_p", "source_sha256": "7595b7d74fdebeaf1c36f215d77308e1f1a65f4a91521e460bafb2b813b481fa", "ja": "そうか……。新しいダンスなんだし、\n最初からできなくて、当然じゃないかな。", "zh": "这样啊……毕竟是新的舞蹈，\n一开始做不好也是理所当然的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0413_1005_030iku", "source_sha256": "932d065345926a5f83cb7e1154bc749ec5486af7ca475a1b676e735138d040ad", "ja": "そうだけど……。この前の運動会のときは、\nすっごく上手におどれたんだよ？", "zh": "虽然是这样……可是上次运动会的时候，\n我明明跳得特别好呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0413_1006_030iku", "source_sha256": "eb82ba113e7240cda1d1418a7d70672cdb99a6059a446c579e5ed9f4612fb93a", "ja": "わたし、ダンスが上手になったって思ってたのに、\nぜんぜんうまくおどれなかったんだもん……。", "zh": "我还以为自己的舞跳得更好了呢，\n结果却根本就跳不好嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0413_1007_p", "source_sha256": "c1f60a9aa5bbdb36f7d4202d3a92add1cfd5491206353b17ca0f6eb6d95a3b96", "ja": "ん？　それって、育のダンスが上手になったから、\n先生もダンスのレベルを上げたってことじゃないか？", "zh": "嗯？也就是说，因为育的舞蹈进步了，所以老师也提高了舞蹈的难度，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0413_1008_030iku", "source_sha256": "9568a68cac751046373a2edd77d77b05380fe0eb95ffd709a6a2f97eeaf57fb3", "ja": "え？　そう、なのかな……？\nでも、また下手になっちゃった気がして……。", "zh": "诶？是、这样吗……？\n可是，我总觉得自己又变差了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0413_1009_p", "source_sha256": "fe6581b1cd0f1520899b580affc0692d7e9eb936046b0cbfec09901a03ab7a72", "ja": "それで自信をなくしてしまった、と。\n……よーし！", "zh": "所以就因此失去自信了啊。\n……好——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0413_1010", "source_sha256": "a50344fb17073756d41cbb917735a19230d9d7401e3c0ffdba3bf9fca67cf001", "ja": "フレー！　フレー！", "zh": "加油！加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0413_2000_030iku", "source_sha256": "76a9bbe35495f558cb03ded4d4aa45b2bf3df36d0831c708db04ad78ef38fe94", "ja": "えっ！？　{$P$}さん！？", "zh": "诶！？　{$P$}先生！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0413_2001_p", "source_sha256": "c5292624b85ce74265221482c434838c86b6f35ce62685b5145a53fa5adc9d67", "ja": "育からはいつも元気をもらってるからな。\n今度は俺が、応援してあげたいんだ！", "zh": "我平时总是从育那里获得活力。这次换我来给你加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0413_2002_030iku", "source_sha256": "5d5caa42d4978fcb1944de7fb9aae5987c42344497cf833135d8eba61583925b", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。\nえへへ、ありがとう！　わたし、元気もらえたよ♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生……  \n嘿嘿，谢谢你！我也得到力量了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0413_2003_030iku", "source_sha256": "8fc329283c719f6cc8d7b6aa7bcef930a7d52a504e3ab922263a60950806caa5", "ja": "それとね、心配かけてごめんなさい。\nひとりで悩まないで、ちゃんと相談すればよかったね。", "zh": "还有，对不起，让你担心了。\n我不该一个人烦恼，早点好好找人商量就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0413_2004_p", "source_sha256": "2b779dd0feab833c9c08949f7870d6e697c71a6e8044ddc53c19d606ae6dbfb4", "ja": "ああ。ひとりで悩むのも大切だけど、劇場には頼りに\nなる人がたくさんいるからな。遠慮なく頼っていいぞ！", "zh": "啊。一个人烦恼也很重要，不过剧场里有很多值得依靠的人。尽管来依靠我们吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0413_2005_030iku", "source_sha256": "3ff9a1faea51a8d0460a227e58a659453a2ddbf0c36b1b3340d1949e2f65746f", "ja": "はーい♪　……あれ？　そういえばどうして\n{$P$}さんはここに来たの？", "zh": "好——♪……咦？说起来，{$P$}先生怎么会来这里的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0413_2006_p", "source_sha256": "8700245d7fb4adf8d4d0d353519d763033695baa0af3f339ecc91415c7dd8dc6", "ja": "ああ、ちょっと気分転換に……。\n今日は大変な仕事があってね。", "zh": "啊，想稍微换换心情……  \n今天有项挺辛苦的工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0413_2007_030iku", "source_sha256": "afdd2c5f76946539b9b85c2c2b9d182b15af6d7595c5080ff74803ab773235f3", "ja": "そっか……じゃあ、{$P$}さん！\n元気になれるように、わたしも応えんしてあげるね！", "zh": "这样啊……那就，{$P$}先生！\n为了让你打起精神，我也来给你加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0413_2008_030iku", "source_sha256": "397408a250d405e69d4d326443e2651d2d3d89ee3524317b8435f900087a1ed1", "ja": "フレー！　フレー！　{$P$}！\nがんばれ！　がんばれ！　{$P$}♪", "zh": "加油！加油！{$P$}！\n加油！加油！{$P$}♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
